    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Adaliya geesit",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gweaydeaba ispwa ghwanyas uurda Yehoyada, ak gwasin neajeeda sea fuga miineadaysa shirikarajeega bughalajeega was geaba Asariya orjeeda Yehoramu, ea Shumwaheeli orjeeda Yehohanani, ea Asariya orjeeda Obedi, ea Maaseya orjeeda Adaya, ea Elishafati orjeeda Sikri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gaweay gwaneaweesa Yuda ak ghoamughuush fuga Lawi aba jeeda mujiinajeega sean bea Yuda, sea fuga hees bea gealga ghweaniga Israeli, ak ghapka Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwasin buuneeda sean neajeeda sea sugoocheanda aba jeeda gheeda ASEETA. Ng'ata gwayeesha Yehoyada saawa, “Ang'ula orjeeda sugoocheanda! Danung' goombaliischi, gawuurji gidanyaashta NG'UTAMIIDA aba badahuuka orjooga Dawdi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nih gichea asina gil: agoogeeda oowooschi ashoohoodiga ea fuga Lawi inyeesa ghoapkaanyi agadiyeena eaweeda sabaato, siyagi aba jeemba fih samwagu gaygafur dooshinga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea siyagi aba jeemba fih samwagu gaygoobiida jeeda gheeda sugoocheanda nea siyagi aba jeemba fih samwagu gaygoobiida gidaghuuta sindeeta; nea fuga sean gaygoobiida jeeda doodooda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adiidu gawa sih jeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA, geaghus ashoohoodiga ea fuga Lawi gadiydooschi; saawa gaygaweay jeeda gheeda, aba gideaba saawa ea ghaydidi, nea fuga suurja sean gaygafur ng'asheega NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea fuga Lawi gaygwaneaweesa sugoocheanda, nea gaba nih mideawa dabita ng'ucheeda aba geatingaaschi; nea siisi nyooh gawa jeeda gheeda gajeabwar ghami. Ooteayeewana sugoocheanda Iinyo gawa gah, ea damanda weah jarooda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean fuga Lawi sea fuga sean bea Yuda gwasinda gidarukteayda Yehoyada heeda waseewa ashoohoocheanda. Hean gaba siisi eadu fugaaschi jea gagadiiy eaweeda sabaato. Aba gideaba ashoohoocheanda was Yehoyada mii ghaheawa lageanyeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ashoohoocheanda was Yehoyada ghoadaw fuga miineadaysa buuneeda ng'utkeaka ea igeambooniga hees ea gea manang'i was gea ghayi bea sugoocheanda was Dawdi, ghayi mida jeeda gheeda ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwanung' ghamiinaada buuneeda sean gafur sugoocheanda, nea gaba nih mideawa dabitaanyi bea ng'ucheeda aba geatingaaschi, gidang'eada wiilooda ng'eanyiida biyeara bea gheeda ea gagul wiilooda ng'eanyiida ghayeawa bea gheeda, ak gwaneaweesa eara heeda wagiida bea gheeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gooruudu jarooda orjeeda sugoocheanda ak ghwayiin shiipka uhuudaanyi, ak geataw gichea ghabeada; ak geembiit ghoah sugoocheanda; aba ng'ata Yehoyada sea orjoagaaschi ghoamwaar niny, ak gwayi, “Gagasa ghwanyas sugoocheanda eaweega geawi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu ghwayiiy Adaliya giijuureanda buuneeda salda nea gwaduumsheesa sugoocheanda, hean ghoabita jeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA heeda mida buuneeda; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hean nea ghoang'wearda, ghwadaah sugoocheanda nea ghamiinaada aba murdeeda daraneadaanyi mida gidaghuuta nea fuga miineadayiisa buuneeda ea gea ghuuda durumbeatajeega gwanda murdeeda sugoocheanda, nea fuga sean bea ng'eanyiida gang'weela nea gaguuda durumbeatajeega, nea fuga sarman gwandeawa dabita nyaawa sarmaniida nea goosheedeayi aba hooseaneega. Ng'ata ghabwaashaada Adaliya hang'weakaaschi, ak gooyeawda nea gwayi, “Munyinda! Munyinda!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gooruudu Yehoyada was ashoohoocheanda jarooda shirikareeda hees sinung' goombal shirikara ak gwayeesha, “Ooruuta jarooda heeda mida lugweega, nea siichea ghwaat geeshta gajeabwara ng'uta.” Aba gideaba gwayi ashoohoocheanda, “Adiidu goonuuschi niny aba jeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean geang'waay; aba ng'ata gawa gwasik dooshta faraasajeega bea gheeda sugoocheanda, hean ak geebarsa hoowa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gidasin Yehoyada",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwasin neajeeda Yehoyada sea fuga sean ea sugoocheanda gideaba gayghoah saawa fuga NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gaweay buuneeda sean gheeh Baali; aba ng'ata gwanyarja gawa ng'eanyi; ea heeda wagiida ea sanaamajeagaaschi ghwalajaada bugusuunatka, aba ng'ata ghabwar ghami Mataneeda was ashoohoocheanda Baali aba madeeda heeda wagiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwaloat Yehoyada fuga jea gafur gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA nea gamiineadaysa ashoohoodiga was fuga Lawi ea fuga Lawi ghayi loat Dawdi ghoah fuga hees jea gamiineadaysa gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA, nea goodawi NG'UTAMIIDA haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi sigwariida, gawuurji gidaghayi sing'waarda aba jeeda diigheanda Musa, bea hooseaneega ea duumsheesiinda, gawuurji gidaghayi rukuneata Dawdi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwayiin fuga jea gafur gidaghuudajeega gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA ea mudu gwanda siichea ghoamu gawa jih mawoosa siida doabiiwaat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghaghwal fuga miineadayiisa buuneeda, ea fuga hees, ea fuga ahaagwiidi buuneeda, ea fuga sean bea ng'eanyiida; ng'ata geahiing'na sugoocheanda jeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ak gwasik gidaghuuta heetiyeada ea ghwahita gheeda sugoocheanda. Ak geenung' goopteada aba uhuuda hoorgeeda gheambalmeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gahoosan fuga sean bea ng'eanyiida ak gaba seayu mujiineeda sean, iining'ata bayiiga Adaliya aba ng'uta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
